    ('38073', 0, $$Bea is a 3 years old girl. Her parents are extremely excited for seeing her daughter's new school. Our Bea is going to a new school first time. I am so excited her mother said. Yes she is getting old. Ma said Bea. Yes Bea!what happened to you?$$),
    ('38073', 1, $$What were you talking about? We were talking about new school. You are going to start a new adventure. Are not you excited? I am happy mom but .......said Bea. Hmm? I am afraid of making new friends. I don't have any friend.$$),
    ('38073', 2, $$Not even one friend said Bea sadly. Oh dear. You don't need to take tension. I know that you are going to be a good friend said her mother. But how can I? Her mom said let me tell you that how you can be a good friend of Every child. I can't wait$$),
    ('38073', 3, $$So you need to be kind and happy to others. Always help everyone and be a good friend. Always tell them to keep smile in your face. Ok ma it's clear Said Bea. Now I am ready to go to school. I can't wait to go to school.$$),
    ('38073', 4, $$Next day,,,Bea are you ready?said mom. Yes ma let's go to school. I am so excited. Let's go fast. Okk. Good morning Bea!!said by Miss Stephan (her class teacher). Good morning ma'am ma'am said her mother. Good morning said Bea softly.$$),
    ('38073', 5, $$Good morning dear. I am Stephan. I am your class teacher but I am going to spend a time with you like your best friend. Thank you ma'am said by her mother. Thank you said Bea. Her mother left the school and go in front of the car.$$),
    ('38073', 6, $$Bea waved her hands and said goodbye to her mother and shouted good bye ma. Her mother said goodbye and said goodbluck dear. Then her class teacher introduced Bea to all children. Bea got shy and said hi in tiny.$$),
