    ('38974', 3, $$Shal you sing some song asked fox. The crow open its mouth that time the cookie was fell down. The fox catch it. So the crow cannot eat.@ MORAL: We should not cheat others$$),
    ('38977', 0, $$Adina is an elderly woman who lives on a farm. She has a garden with different kinds of flowers, but her favourite are sunflowers. Adina usually takes a walk in her garden of flowers each morning, just after sunrise.$$),
    ('38977', 1, $$One morning, as she was taking her usual walk through her garden of flowers, the weather started to change all at once. It became cloudy and darker then suddenly lightning struck. Adina got startled by the sudden change of weather.$$),
    ('38977', 2, $$She had to make her way back to the house as it was starting to rain. As Adina was rushing back, she slipped on a small puddle of water on the grass and she had a bad fall.$$),
    ('38977', 3, $$Adina's fall put her in bed for a while because she had injured her back. She could no longer go for her morning walk in the garden. Her neighbours went to visit her and she told them how much she missed her walk in the garden of flowers.$$),
    ('38977', 4, $$Adina was sad. She felt heartbroken. Her neighbours decided to pick one of Adina's sunflowers and bring it to her. Adina was extremely excited when she took a glance, smelled her favourite flower and immediately she felt better.$$),
    ('39060', 0, $$“The day has finally arrived! I can’t believe it, I am officially a teenager. I suddenly feel a little taller. Mom, dad make way for your teenaged daughter! ”$$),
    ('39060', 1, $$I walked through the house, and to my surprise, no one was there! I heard laughter and cheering in the distance and immediately thought. “It must be for me, the birthday girl. ”$$),
    ('39060', 2, $$Sadly, my family said absolutely nothing. The boys continued to play soccer, and mom and dad greeted me like they do every other day.$$),
    ('39060', 3, $$My heart sank and my eyes began to fill with tears. The boys rushed to my side and asked, “What’s wrong? ” l shrugged my shoulders, walked away and wondered “Why would they ask, surely they know it’s my big big day. ”$$),
    ('39060', 4, $$I made my way to my best friend, because I knew that Lebo would never forget my birthday. But she too, had nothing to say about my special day. I ran to our special tree and made my way up to the top.$$),
    ('39060', 5, $$From the bottom of the tree, mom and dad yelled “Thandi, come down from the tree, we have something to show you! ” I made my way down from the tree and walked back home with mom and dad.$$),
    ('39060', 6, $$When I made my way to the gate, all I could hear were the loud screams of everyone saying “SURPRISE!! ” Mom stood by my side and whispered in my ear “Surely you didn’t think we would forget your big big day. ”$$),
    ('39060', 7, $$I was speechless. I smiled from ear to ear and couldn’t believe that everyone pulled off this big surprise.$$),
    ('39100', 0, $$Poky is a beautiful baby kitten who lived in a village. She followed Mama Cat to the river. She did not see where Mama Cat turned. She got lost.$$),
    ('39100', 1, $$She saw a beautiful dog and followed her. The dog barked at Poky, "Woof! Woof! " Poky cried "Meow! Meow! " and ran away.$$),
    ('39100', 2, $$Poky did not find her way home. She cried more, "Meow, Meow! "$$),
    ('39100', 3, $$While Poky was walking, she bumped into the dog again. "It's you again! " The dog felt very sorry for Poky. She helped Poky to search for her mother.$$),
    ('39100', 4, $$On the way, they saw a rabbit and asked, "Did you see Mama Cat? " The rabbit replied, "No, I didn't see her. "$$),
    ('39100', 5, $$Then, they saw a bird and asked, "Did you see Mama Cat? " The bird replied, "I saw her. If you follow me, I will show you where she is. "$$),
    ('39100', 6, $$After a long walk, they finally found Mama Cat in the river. Mama Cat was searching for food for Poky.$$),
    ('39100', 7, $$Poky was very happy to see her mother again. They hugged each other.$$),
