    ('39283', 0, $$Yolanda had a thought this afternoon. "I should eat healthier. " "That's a great thought, Yolanda. What food do you have in mind? " "Fruit," she said.$$),
    ('39283', 1, $$"Okay. Once we're finished coloring, we'll go to the store and buy some more fruit. " "Yay. Thank you, mom. " "Do you want to color a rainbow like me? "$$),
    ('39283', 2, $$"Yes ma'am. " "Here are the colors I used. Red, orange, yellow, green, blue, and purple. "$$),
    ('39283', 3, $$"Thank you. " "How do you know which healthy foods to eat? " "I study nutrition. It's good to have a well balanced diet of every food group. "$$),
