    ('39471', 0, $$Noku was a very brave and hardworking girl. She was also very clever. She went to school and also helped in the garden.$$),
    ('39471', 1, $$But what she liked to do most was to wander in nature. She searched for wild fruits and tended to her little garden. She liked to eat wild fruits and knew all of their names.$$),
    ('39471', 2, $$Grandmother had taught her to be very careful not to touch or eat fruits she did not know.$$),
